{"seq":1,"slug":"the-man-from-meng","title":"The Man From Meng","docCount":2,"url":"/c/people/zhuangzi/life-and-times/the-man-from-meng","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"life-and-legend","title":"生平与传说","url":"/c/people/zhuangzi/life-and-times/the-man-from-meng/life-and-legend","wordCount":1980,"readingTime":8},{"seq":2,"slug":"the-lacquer-garden-official","title":"漆园吏","url":"/c/people/zhuangzi/life-and-times/the-man-from-meng/the-lacquer-garden-official","wordCount":1746,"readingTime":7}],"introMarkdown":"本章追溯庄子的生平与传说。庄子，名周，宋国蒙地人，关于他的可靠史料极少，更多与传说交织。他曾做过卑微的\"漆园吏\",生活清贫却精神超然、安贫乐道；他与名家代表惠施既论辩又相知（如\"濠梁之辩\"）。本章呈现这位生活清贫、精神超然的隐者形象，以及传说中那超脱、自由、智慧、诙谐的庄子。\n"}